    "created_at": "2020-08-20T16:03:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-20T16:03:59Z",
    "body": "@GoncaloGarcia a bit late, but I guess you meant to disable separating your prompt on two lines (one for directory, and one for the prompt itself), this can be achieved using the `line_break` module, it was a bit confusing to me, so, I guess this could be helpful :sweat_smile: \r\n\r\nhttps://starship.rs/config/#line-break \r\n\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n# ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n\r\n[line_break]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
